                      "name": "Gloss",
                      "fill": "$ink-soft",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Relief first, readiness second. The relief is that the searching stops being yours. The readiness is that the interview is not the first time you say it out loud.",
